OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBands of
OL,6,Fheavy showers with a risk of hail and
OL,7,Fthunder moving northeastwards
OL,8,Fovernight, although easing from the
OL,9,Fwest later. Temperatures a little
OL,10,Fabove average, with most towns and
OL,11,Fcities staying in double figures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA cloudy start with outbreaks
OL,14,Fof rain and showers, these heaviest
OL,15,Facross the north, with a risk of
OL,16,Fthunder. Turning drier and brighter
OL,17,Fthrough the afternoon. Breezy. Average
OL,18,Ftemperatures.
